<title>POLAND: KOMPAP TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 42.</title>
<headline>KOMPAP TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 42.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 50,000 shares of Polish paper firm Kompap SA at 42 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Kompap shares traded at 44.7 zlotys in a volume of 18,752 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
